<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Weirton Steel upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Weirton Steel upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Richard Aldrich upgraded Weirton Steel Corp to buy from neutral &quot;on a near-term trading basis.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said in a summary report that stock &quot;looks quite cheap on several measures&quot; and has not moved with other steel stocks.</p>
<p>-- said company's earnings per share momentum should be positive over the next few quarters even granted some expected modest spot pricing pressure.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/2 to 3-1/2.</p>
</text>
